  "title": "Anyone Can Make BBQ Pulled Pork",
  "description": "Slow-cooked in a blend of coffee, Worcestershire sauce, and liquid smoke, this shredded pork sandwich filling is spicy with red pepper flakes and your favorite barbecue sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "JOYCE"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T03:01:53-04:00",
